  "notes": [
    "`brand/inline/` comes from systems/sebaro/brand/inline/, which no gate of sebaro-foundry checks for freshness (it is written by a script of the system, not by tools/brand_assets.py).",
    "The PNGs in `brand/og/` are the workshop's sample share images. Their HTML templates (brand/src/og/) load tokens, fonts and scripts relative to the system folder and stay in sebaro-foundry; a site renders its own pages with `brand/og/render.mjs` (README, section Share images).",
    "`brand/inline/sign-<id>*.svg`, `brand/inline/tile-<id>*.svg` and `demo/products.css` are the demo's 10 sample products (demo data of sebaro-foundry, systems/sebaro/demo/products/): the system lists no product. Load `demo/products.css` after `tokens.css` where a page shows them. The site's own favicons, manifest and head snippet come from the product kit in `product/`, from the site's own declaration (README, section Product files).",
    "8 excluded product(s) left out (--exclude-products, $SEBARO_EXCLUDE_PRODUCTS): no file names them, and this record keeps only their number. `--verify` needs the same list."
